# TAG API Page Development Guidelines

## API Page Template

    page [ID] "TAG API [EntityName]"
    {
        PageType = API;

        APIVersion = 'v1.0';
        APIPublisher = 'verosoftdesign';
        APIGroup = 'tag';

        EntityCaption = 'TAG API [EntityName]';
        EntitySetCaption = 'TAG API [EntityNames]';
        EntityName = '[entityName]';
        EntitySetName = '[EntityNames]';

        SourceTable = "TAG [EntityName]";
        ODataKeyFields = SystemId;

        Extensible = true;
        InsertAllowed = true;
        ModifyAllowed = true;
        DeleteAllowed = true;
        DelayedInsert = true;

        layout
        {
            area(Content)
            {
                repeater(Group)
                {
                    // System Fields - Always include first
                    field(id; Rec.SystemId)
                    {
                        Editable = false;
                    }
                    field(systemCreatedAt; Rec.SystemCreatedAt)
                    {
                        Editable = false;
                    }
                    field(systemModifiedAt; Rec.SystemModifiedAt)
                    {
                        Editable = false;
                    }
                    
                    // Entity fields
                    field(code; Rec.Code)
                    {
                    }
                    field(description; Rec.Description)
                    {
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

## API Naming Conventions

- EntityName: camelCase singular (e.g., keySafe, workOrder)
- EntitySetName: PascalCase plural (e.g., KeySafes, WorkOrders)
- Field names: camelCase (e.g., serialNo, masterLock)

## Standard API Properties

    APIVersion = 'v1.0';
    APIPublisher = 'verosoftdesign';
    APIGroup = 'tag';
    ODataKeyFields = SystemId;

## System Fields

Always include these system fields first in every API page:

    field(id; Rec.SystemId)
    {
        Editable = false;
    }
    field(systemCreatedAt; Rec.SystemCreatedAt)
    {
        Editable = false;
    }
    field(systemModifiedAt; Rec.SystemModifiedAt)
    {
        Editable = false;
    }

## Calculated Fields

Expose table procedures as API fields:

    field(available; Rec.Available())
    {
    }
    field(isolationPoint; Rec.IsolationPoint())
    {
    }

## Permission Settings

    InsertAllowed = true;   // Allow POST
    ModifyAllowed = true;   // Allow PATCH
    DeleteAllowed = true;   // Allow DELETE
    DelayedInsert = true;   // Recommended for API pages

## API Endpoints

The resulting API endpoint will be:

    /api/verosoftdesign/tag/v1.0/companies({companyId})/[EntitySetName]